    "agent10-nine-carry-sharp": {
      "status": "PASS",
      "scope": "Exact uniform complete-carry observation threshold nine for all active initial pair coefficients of admissible words and for the next integer of canonical ordinary decimal inputs at a common initial width. Reuses the unchanged nine-word upper bound and a direct kernel-certified width17 eight-word collision. Includes all prior13 modules and the preserved seven-word example. Every terminal carry is observed; ordinary iteration continues after a palindrome. No initial-integer injectivity or palindrome-avoidance claim.",
